{"id":"c977bae1afa646f1","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion2-index-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Index Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-index-set — ZFC Recursion2 Index Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-index-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-index-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-index-set — ZFC Recursion2 Index Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-index-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-index-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-index-set — ZFC Recursion2 Index Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\mathcal P\\in V\">\\(I,\\mathcal P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\varphi_e:e\\in\\omega\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\varphi_e:e\\in\\omega\\rangle\\)</span> (上游固定的可接受一元部分可计算函数编号, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (一元部分可计算函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PC}_1\">\\(\\mathsf{PC}_1\\)</span> (本文件定义的一元部分可计算函数载体)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2IndexSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2IndexSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}index\\text{-}set\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\\mathsf{PC}_1\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}index\\text{-}set\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\\mathsf{PC}_1\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2IndexSet}_S(I,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{PC}_1\n\\land I=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2IndexSet}_S(I,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{PC}_1\n\\land I=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>属性参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 被形式化为一元部分可计算函数的集合，而不是把集合当作可调用谓词；因此指标集自动只依赖编号函数的外延值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle\\varphi_e:e\\in\\omega\\rangle$ (上游固定的可接受一元部分可计算函数编号, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\\subseteq V$ (一元部分可计算函数谓词, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\mathcal P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\